Notes (why some items are missed):
- "Give All" will stop giving many items once a pocket is full. After that point, `CheckItemSpace` will return 0 for items in that pocket, and the script will keep skipping those items while still giving items from other pockets that still have free slots.
- This is not an `items.inc` index problem. It’s just the bag's fixed per-pocket slot limits (distinct item slots).

Recommended Alpha/Playtest alternative:
- Use the item-category picker script instead of "Give All":
  - Script: C:\\GitHub\\Pokemon-Spectral-Dream\\Data\\Script-Data\\Scripts\\0965.script
  - Text:   C:\\GitHub\\Pokemon-Spectral-Dream\\Data\\Text-Data\\0965.txt
- It lets the player choose a pocket/category, then browse items in that category (paged), then choose a quantity (1/10/99) and receive it for free.

Bag size expansion:
- There is no simple toggle in the provided `hg-engine` config files to expand bag pocket sizes.
- Expanding the bag generally means changing the `NUM_BAG_*` pocket sizes and the save/bag data layout (which is more invasive than a script change).
